{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36544","headline":"吴门再逢方干处士 · 罗邺","name":"吴门再逢方干处士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天上高名世上身，垂纶何不驾蒲轮。\n一朝卿相俱前席，千古篇章冠後人。\n稽岭不归空挂梦，吴宫相值欲沾巾。\n吾王若致昇平化，可独成周只渭滨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36544.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36544","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}